# 4 KB guest pages — the variant for a 4 KB-page guest userland.
#
# The port defaults to 16 KB (see patches/0025): Android 15+ hosts are 16 KB
# and a guest page can never be smaller than the host's.  A 4 KB guest is what
# you want when the HOST is 4 KB and the guest userland assumes 4 KB arena
# alignment — Debian/Ubuntu arm64 images, older Android system images (a
# redroid linker64 dies inside its first init path on a 16 KB guest, measured
# on a 4 KB host).
#
# Do NOT run this artifact on a 16 KB host: the kernel refuses at boot
# (os_early_checks) because guest >= host is a hard requirement.  Equal-or-
# larger host pages are fine: one guest page is then one host mmap().
#
# merge_config semantics: "# CONFIG_X is not set" is the disable line.
# CONFIG_PAGE_SIZE_16KB is not set
CONFIG_PAGE_SIZE_4KB=y
